- Write 250-350 words
- Professional MLS tone
- SEO-optimized (include property type, city, neighborhood name, school names, key features)
- Highlight walkability and location benefits prominently
- Include bullet points for key features
- Mention specific schools by name for SEO
- End with strong call-to-action
- Return ONLY the description text, no formatting markers

